# Product documentation

Canonical docs live under `docs/`:

- `PRD.md` — requirements, phases, status tables
- `ARCHITECTURE.md` — layers, flows, data model
- `DESIGN_SYSTEM.md` — tokens, components, theming

When implementing a planned nav module (expenses, budgets, etc.), update PRD status and enable nav only when the route works. Reflect schema/layer changes in ARCHITECTURE. New colors or component patterns belong in DESIGN_SYSTEM (prefer CSS variables over hard-coded values).
